{"4670670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cronus' Tomb: First Quest", "steam_appid": 4670670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of crevices have suddenly appeared across Corfu, all leading deep underground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security forces across the island have been stretched thin as both locals and tourists clamber to find out why they are here; and where they may go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your opportunity to make a name for yourself! Equipped with 30 feet of rope and a blade, descend into Cronus' Tomb, and become the first to share the news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cronus' Tomb: First Quest is a top-down action-adventure game that thrusts you into the forgotten corners of Greek mythology. Explore the tomb, uncover its secrets, and meet its conniving inhabitants; or what remains of them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Cronus' Tomb: First Quest, you can: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a labyrinth of rotten chambers, all lovingly and carefully crafted to be as unique as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, stab, and slash enemies with tight, responsive controls, as you push deeper into the tomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a story that takes place over fragmented vignettes of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for that all important sense of purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you'll get lucky and run into another explorer, or two?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not realise that the game hasn't ended yet and quit early.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be talked at by a cast of strange and pathetic characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique items that aid you in exploring areas new and old; not too many of them though.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and fight to an expansive and eclectic OST.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub your eyes and double-take at nice, if maybe a little underbaked, pixel art.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of crevices have suddenly appeared across Corfu, all leading deep underground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security forces across the island have been stretched thin as both locals and tourists clamber to find out why they are here; and where they may go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your opportunity to make a name for yourself! Equipped with 30 feet of rope and a blade, descend into Cronus' Tomb, and become the first to share the news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cronus' Tomb: First Quest is a top-down action-adventure game that thrusts you into the forgotten corners of Greek mythology. Explore the tomb, uncover its secrets, and meet its conniving inhabitants; or what remains of them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Cronus' Tomb: First Quest, you can: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a labyrinth of rotten chambers, all lovingly and carefully crafted to be as unique as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, stab, and slash enemies with tight, responsive controls, as you push deeper into the tomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a story that takes place over fragmented vignettes of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for that all important sense of purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you'll get lucky and run into another explorer, or two?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not realise that the game hasn't ended yet and quit early.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be talked at by a cast of strange and pathetic characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique items that aid you in exploring areas new and old; not too many of them though.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and fight to an expansive and eclectic OST.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rub your eyes and double-take at nice, if maybe a little underbaked, pixel art.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Descend into Cronus' Tomb and revel in the spoils of being on the forefront of discovery. Explore a labyrinth of ancient chambers, fighting monsters from forgotten corners of Greek mythology, and maybe even uncover why no one has been there before.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670670/f9861f2f5f7e16b0f9ee181b8d228c5a31385354/header.jpg?t=1782404514", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670670/598c56f5b5e4458109b516ef2601da9d9514cd49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782404514", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670670/598c56f5b5e4458109b516ef2601da9d9514cd49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782404514", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX 10 / 11 / 12 compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 540 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong